Description: Spotlight-style launcher for GNOME
 hopla opens a small floating box (Super+Space) to search and open
 installed apps, files in your home folder, your GitHub repositories
 and the web, all from the keyboard.
 .
 File search uses fd and the GitHub tab uses the GitHub CLI (gh).
